 "text": "Hi, how you doing right now? Great project. The first step is deciding what you want to talk about. Is it one big topic, or bunch of little topics? Then could do a cooking show with a historical twist, or a comedy series about strange food facts. Which feels more fun? For cooking shows, a phone and an audio app are all you need. Many people record in kitchen corner with an Iphone and an audio cord. Great idea. Five minute episodes are easier to stick with than thirty. Short and regular is the key to successful podcast.",
